Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:26:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 29/32] Casa: the doorbell card's rules (open only after a real
 ring, close after 90 s, motion, pause)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
